623:\section{Exact Algorithms}
625:\subsection{General graphs}
626:In this section, we present exact algorithms for \pauvc for general graphs. 
627:We first see exact exponential-time algorithms, and then see FPT algorithms for vertex cover number. 
630:\subsubsection{Exponential-time algorithms}
631:We first present an exact algorithm that utilizes an algorithm for \textsc{Unique Vertex Cover}~(\textsc{UVC}). 
633:We first fix a subset of vertices $U \subseteq V(G)$ for a pre-assignment, and then check if $G$ has a unique minimum vertex cover under the pre-assignment $U$.
634:This can be done by transforming $G$ into $G'$ as in~\Cref{cor:unique_alg}: $G' \coloneqq G - U$ for the \textsc{Include} model and $G' \coloneqq G - U - N(U)$ for the \textsc{Exclude} model.
636:\begin{algorithm}[H]
637:\begin{algorithmic}
642:    \State $G' \gets$ the graph obtained from $G$ under pre-assignment on $U$
648:\end{algorithmic}
