+"""Verified generator for pre-assignment uniquification of Vertex Cover.
+
+The construction follows the bipartite reduction in Section 3 of
+arXiv:2312.10599.  A planted independent dominating set D in a bipartite core
+G is known before the instance is built.  Attaching one private leaf v' to
+each core vertex v gives G'; Lemma 4 proves that excluding D leaves exactly
+one minimum vertex cover of G'.
+"""
+
