+        "core-edge adjacency lookup",
+        "independence check",
+        "closed-neighborhood domination check",
+    ],
+    "domain_essentiality": "licensed_reduction",
+    "reduction_kind": "paper_licensed",
+    "reduction": (
+        "Section 3, Lemmas 4 and 5 and Theorem 3: the pendant-corona "
+        "reduction from bipartite Independent Dominating Set to PAU-VC"
+    ),
+    "reduction_source": "paper_central",
+    "intuition_type": "constraint propagation",
+    "intuition_description": (
+        "Across the two core colour classes the wanted vertices form a small "
+        "all-zero rectangle whose closed neighborhoods cover the core; without "
+        "propagating both conditions one must branch over core subsets."
