+and the noise rate balances their expected degrees.  The panel tests degree
+outliers, deterministic domination-gain greedy, randomized greedy restarts,
+and an exact branch-and-propagate search for a size-k independent dominating
+set.  The latter is the domain-standard attack for the paper's reduction.
+The canonical key is a Weisfeiler--Lehman refinement invariant of the marked
+core graph; it is relabelling-invariant but not a complete isomorphism test.
+""".strip()
