codex
The patched construction now has a real second hardness dial: it first balances planted incidences, then makes the decoy noise exactly biregular, eliminating degree leakage while keeping the answer length fixed at ten labels. Preliminary checks show the exact brancher still exhausts its cap and the spectral/greedy attacks still fail; the full 200,000-sample and eight-seed gate suite is running now.
