All requested files now exist, including harness-produced bare, hinted, and placebo transcripts. I’m doing the final static and mathematical audit: syntax/import behavior, determinism, answer JSON round-trip, hint isolation, and an independent brute-force check on the demo that the local independent-dominating-set predicate exactly matches “unique minimum cover avoiding \(X\).”
